DESCRIPTION:An Evening of Scottish Fiddle\; featuring Isabel Oliart & Kyra 
 Davies with Eamon Sefton on guitar Tickets: $20 in advance\, $25 at door\,
  $15 for seniors This concert is part of the Trad on the Mystic organized 
 by Ellery Klein and hosted at Arts Collaborative Medford Isabel Oliart is 
 a Boston-based fiddler spanning the the worlds of Classical and Celtic fid
 dle music. She earned a BA from New England Conservatory in 2019\, and an 
